<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Enersis cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Enersis cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell cut its rating for Chilean power company Enersis SA Wednesday to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- The downgrade was based on poor expected results in 1997, the firm said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were off 1/8 to 30-1/4 in late-morning trade.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
